(98, 'The Registrar has to register the proposed change in object clause within Ã¢â‚¬Â¦Ã¢â‚¬Â¦Ã¢â‚¬Â¦Ã¢â‚¬Â¦Ã¢â‚¬Â¦. days of receipt of special resolution by company being published contents as mentioned in section 13 (6(a) of the Companies Act, 2013.', '["30 days","15 days","60 days","10 days"]'::jsonb, 0, NULL),
(99, 'Memorandum of Association and Article of Association are public documents. True or False', '["True","False","Partly True","Partly False"]'::jsonb, 0, 'Every person need to knowledge of MOA and AOA of the company. That the dealing with the company may know without reasonable doubt whether the contractual relationship which he is proposing to enter into with the company is one relating to matters within its corporate object. The outsider or the 3 rd party dealing with the Company shall have the knowledge of the MOA and AOA of the company'),
(100, 'The AOA provides that directors selling good beyond Rs. 1 Crore shall be signed by MD of the Company. The director sold the goods of Rs. 1.20 Crore without approval of MD. The contract is valid or Invalid.', '["Valid","Invalid","Partly Valid","Partly Invalid"]'::jsonb, 1, 'The Company shall not work beyond the power of its MOA and AOA. Any act done be yond the MOA and AOA will be considered as void - ab - initio, called as Doctrine of Ultra Virus. If the contract beyond the limit of MOA and AOA it will be void and 3 rd party or outsider cannot claim any compensation for the same as it is assumed that he ha d knowledge of contravention through MOA or AOA, called as Doctrine of Constructive Notice'),
(101, 'The AOA provides that a bill of exchange must be signed by two directors, if the bill is actually signed by one director only, the holder thereof cannot claim payment thereon. The contract is valid or Invalid.', '["Valid","Invalid","Partly Valid","Partly Invalid"]'::jsonb, 1, 'The Company shall not work beyond the power of its MOA and AOA. Any act done beyond the MOA and AOA will be considered as void - ab - initio, called as D octrine of Ultra Virus. If the contract beyond the limit of MOA and AOA it will be void and 3 rd party or outsider cannot claim any compensation for the same as it is assumed that he had knowledge of contravention through MOA or AOA, called as Doctrine of C onstructive Notice'),
(102, 'If Mr. Rajaram supplies medicine to ABC Ltd. in which it cannot deal according to its object clause, he will not be able to recover the price from the company. The contract is valid or Invalid.', '["Valid","Invalid","Partly Valid","Partly Invalid"]'::jsonb, 1, 'The Company shall not work beyond the power of its MOA and AOA. Any act done beyond the MOA and AOA will be considered as void - ab - initio, called as Doctrine of Ultra Virus. If the contract beyond the limit of MOA and AOA it will be void and 3 rd party or outsider cannot claim any compensation for the same as it is assumed that he had knowledge of contravention through MOA or AOA, ca lled as Doctrine of Constructive Notice'),
(103, 'The bank has policy to issue bond after passing ordinary resolution in board meeting. The Director of the Bank issued bonds to Mr. Ram without passing resolution. He assumed that ordinary resolution is passed board meeting by Company. The Bank demanded the bonds back contending the issue is invalid as resolution is not passed. Whether the company is doing valid or in valid?', '["Valid","Invalid","Partly Valid","Partly Invalid"]'::jsonb, 1, 'As per Doctrine of Indoor Management, 3 rd party need not have knowledge process of Company. Contract is invalid for the protection of 3 rd party'),
(104, 'Any act done beyond the Memorandum of Association and Article of Association will be considered as void -ab - intio is called asÃ¢â‚¬Â¦Ã¢â‚¬Â¦Ã¢â‚¬Â¦Ã¢â‚¬Â¦Ã¢â‚¬Â¦', '["Doctrine of Ultra Virus","Doctrine of Constructive Notice","Doctrine of Indoor Management","None of the above"]'::jsonb, 0, NULL),
(105, 'MOA and AOA are public documents. The outsider or the 3 rd party dealing with the company shall have knowledge of the MOA and AOA of the Company, is called asÃ¢â‚¬Â¦Ã¢â‚¬Â¦Ã¢â‚¬Â¦Ã¢â‚¬Â¦Ã¢â‚¬Â¦.', '["Doctrine of Ultra Virus","Doctrine of Constructive Notice","Doctrine of Indoor Management","None of the above"]'::jsonb, 1, NULL),
(106, 'The outsider or the 3 rd party dealing with the company shall have knowledge of the MOA and AOA of the Company but they need not have knowledge process of Company, is called asÃ¢â‚¬Â¦Ã¢â‚¬Â¦Ã¢â‚¬Â¦Ã¢â‚¬Â¦Ã¢â‚¬Â¦.', '["Doctrine of Ultra Virus","Doctrine of Constructive Notice","Doctrine of Indoor Management","None of the above"]'::jsonb, 2, NULL),
(107, 'An ultra vires transaction will not affect the right of a company to acquire property. True or False.', '["True","False","Partly True","Partly False"]'::jsonb, 0, 'The property represents corporate capital, though acquired wrongly. Where the payment foe an ultra vires acquired property has not been made, the vendor can obtain a tracing order to recover the property from the hands of the company. A company cannot be benefit from such transaction at th e cost of the property'),
(108, 'M/S ABC Ltd is incorporated at 1 st June 2015 then within how many days Registered office formed to be compulsorily from the date of incorporation.', '["30 days","60 days","15 days","10 days"]'::jsonb, 0, 'As per Companies Amendment act, 2017, the registered office will be set up at or before 30 th June, 2015'),
(109, 'Registered office of the company should be verified and such verification should be sent to registrar within Ã¢â‚¬Â¦Ã¢â‚¬Â¦Ã¢â‚¬Â¦. Days of incorporation.', '["30 days","60 days","15 days","10 days"]'::jsonb, 0, 'As per Companies Amendment act, 2017'),
(110, 'Registered office formed to be compulsorily within Ã¢â‚¬Â¦Ã¢â‚¬Â¦Ã¢â‚¬Â¦Ã¢â‚¬Â¦.. Days of incorporation that will form medium for all the communication to be made with or by Company.', '["30 days","60 days","15 days","10 days"]'::jsonb, 0, 'As per Companies Amendment act, 2017'),
(111, 'M/S ABC Ltd. a company registered in the Pune city, desires to shift its registered office within a city. Whether Company can do so?', '["Yes","No","Partly Yes","Partly No"]'::jsonb, 0, 'Such change will require the ordinary resolution of Board of Directors(Section 13 of the Companies Act, 2013'),
(112, 'M/S ABC Ltd. a company registered in the Pune city, desires to shift its registered office from Pune to Solapur. Whether Company can do so?', '["Yes","No","Partly Yes","Partly No"]'::jsonb, 0, 'Such change will require the ordinary resolution of Board of Directors and special resolution in General meeting(Section 13 of the Companies Act, 2013'),
(113, 'M/S ABC Ltd. a company registered in the Pune city, desires to shift its registered office from Pune to Mumbai. State the process of change?', '["Resolution of Board of Directors","Special resolution in General meeting","Both ROC approval","All of the above"]'::jsonb, 3, NULL),
(114, 'M/S ABC Ltd. a company registered in the state of Maharashtra, desires to shift its registered office to state of West Bengal. State the process of change?', '["Resolution of Board of Directors and Special resolution in General meeting","Both ROC approval","Prior approval of CG","All of the above"]'::jsonb, 3, NULL),
(115, 'Which alteration clause of Memorandum of Association required ordinary resolution in General meeting instead of special resolution?', '["Change in name clause","Change in Registered Office","Alteration of capital","None of the above"]'::jsonb, 2, 'Section 61 of the Companies Act, 2013 is specific and Section 13 of the Companies Act, 2013 is general for all clauses. Thus section 61 will override the Section 13 for alteration of capital clause which required Ordinary r esolution in General meeting'),
(116, 'M/S ABC Ltd. a company desires for alteration of capital, which type of resolution is required for this alteration?', '["Special resolution of general meeting","Ordinary resolution of general meeting","Unanimous resolution","None of the above"]'::jsonb, 1, NULL),
(117, 'State the Object of the Non Ã¢â‚¬â€œ Profit Organization?', '["Charitable object- Education, Research, social welfare, Environment Protection, charity Religious, donation","Income usage- Net income from the business and donations shall be used only for the charitable object","Restriction on Dividend- The company shall not pay dividend to members however it can pay interest on Debenture, Deposits, etc.","All of the above"]'::jsonb, 3, NULL),
(118, 'State the consequences of contravention of Section 8 (Non-Profit Organization) of the companies Act, 2013.', '["Penalty Ã¢â‚¬â€œ For Company minimum 10 lacs For officer Rs. 25000-Rs. 25 Lacs + 3 yrs. of jail","Revocation of license of Section 8 Company.","Company will be wound up or amalgamated with other Section 8 Company","All of the above"]'::jsonb, 3, NULL),
(119, 'Section 8 company will be either public or private. True or False.', '["True","False","Partly True","Partly False"]'::jsonb, 0, NULL)
) as v(question_no, question, options, correct_index, hint)
where b.title = 'CA Inter Law MCQs by Darshan Khare'
