(1, 'Rule of liberal construction should generally be applied in which type of case.', '["criminal case","civil case","labour and welfare case","property case"]'::jsonb, 2, 'rule of liberal construction should generally be applied to labour and welfare case as it Involves question of facts.'),
(2, 'Which out of the following is/are presumption for interpretation of statute?', '["A statute is not Intended to be consistent with principles of international law","the state is not affected by a statute unless It specifically mention","guilty mind is required for a criminal act","all of the above"]'::jsonb, 3, 'all of the above are presumed for interpreting a statute'),
