(14, 'Which rule of Interpretation means, interpreting a statute or other document by reference to the exposition it has received from contemporary authority', '["rule of exceptional construction","noscitur a sociis","expression unis est exclusion alterius","contemporanea exposition"]'::jsonb, 3, 'the maxim Contemporanea exposition means interpreting a statue or other document by reference to the exposition it has received from contemporary authority.'),
