(18, 'For imposing social conduct on people, certain laws are enacted by the legislature for imposing fines and penalty on wrong doer, the law is called:', '["criminal law","property law","law of tort","penal laws"]'::jsonb, 3, 'penal laws are enacted by the legislature for imposing fines and penalty on wrong doer.'),
