(20, 'The general words must follow the specific words is condition of which rule of interpretation:', '["rule of literal construction","rule of reasonable construction","rule of harmonious construction","rule of ejusdem generis"]'::jsonb, 3, 'The general words must follow the specific words is condition of rule of ejusdem generis.'),
(23, 'What is not interpreted as stating a general rule:', '["Explanations","Interpretation Clause","marginal notes","proviso"]'::jsonb, 1, 'Proviso are is not interpreted as stating a general rule.'),
