(29, 'Which of the following are not internal or intrinsic aids to interpretation:', '["schedule","proviso","punctuation","none of the above"]'::jsonb, 3, 'All of them are Internal or Intrinsic aids to Interpretation.'),
(30, 'Which of the following word when used would not of itself make the provision of the act mandatory, but prima facie when used by statute. it is mandatory', '["may","must","shall","should"]'::jsonb, 2, 'The word Ã¢â‚¬ËœshallÃ¢â‚¬â„¢ when used not of itself make the provision of the act mandatory, but prime facie when used by statute, it is mandatory.'),
