(40, 'Rule of beneficial construction is also called:', '["ut res magis valeat quam pereat rule","heydon rule","aquo tacit per allum per se rule","all of the above."]'::jsonb, 1, 'Rule of beneficial construction is also called heydon rule'),
(41, 'What is the process by which the real meaning of the act or a document and the intention of the legislature in enacting it is ascertained?', '["preamble","statutes","interpretation","construction"]'::jsonb, 2, 'Interpretation is the process by which the real meaning of the act or a document and the intention of the legislature in enacting it is ascertained.'),
(42, 'Which of the following interpretation applies when there is actual rule of law which binds the judge to place a certain interpretation of the statute:', '["Doctrinal interpretation","legal interpretation","usual Interpretation","logical interpretation"]'::jsonb, 1, 'legal interpretation applies when there is actual rule of law which binds the Judge to place a certain interpretation of the statute.'),
(43, 'What is termed as drawing of conclusion respecting subjects that lie beyond the direct expression of the text:', '["interpretation","construction","summary","plaint"]'::jsonb, 1, 'construction is termed as drawing of conclusion respecting subjects that lie beyond the direct expression of the text.'),
